{"data": [{"author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:46:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110034466572042454"], "id": "2110034466572042454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109952867822174465", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tip to people who don't know. If you value your life and want to comeback home alive and unharmed, never visit this pandal. Pathetic crowd management since time immemorial, exit is all the way other side. It takes 2-3 hours in evening to visit this pandal alone. https://t.co/Lxg9Hp8XyG", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2110034466572042454"}, {"author_id": "1761130055802249216", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:41:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110033241814319198"], "id": "2110033241814319198", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2984759896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109808107019006248", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MikeyCee24 MLB corruption allowing a shit city to have a team. Sell them to Portland or salt lake and it will be PACKED", "url": "https://x.com/CCHReynolds/status/2110033241814319198"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110028008040058880"]}, "author_id": "1483750132957212672", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:21:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110028054659772483"], "id": "2110028054659772483", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "\ud83d\udea8 SUPER FLOP FIRST RUN? \ud83d\udea8\n\n\ud83d\ude8608183 Tatanagar\u2013Buxar Festival Special\u2019s first run reportedly sees 85\u201390% of seats VACANT! \n\nPoor planning? This train should\u2019ve started just before Diwali and continued until at least a week after Chhath P